# =============================================================================
# AgriRent Environment Configuration Templates
# =============================================================================
# AgriRent maintains decoupled environment files for backend and frontend:
#
# 1. Backend:
#    See backend/.env.example for database, JWT, Brevo, and Cloudinary settings.
#    Copy backend/.env.example to backend/.env
#
# 2. Frontend:
#    See frontend/.env.example for Vite API proxy and base URL settings.
#    Copy frontend/.env.example to frontend/.env
#
# IMPORTANT: Never commit actual .env files containing secrets to version control.
